{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014AyvS1ccnWgGuGtgPuzqEV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner announced\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Live coverage of the announcement of the 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilfoglio.it/en/culture/2026/10/08/news/live-coverage-of-the-announcement-of-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature--409956\"},{\"title\":\"Prize announcement\",\"url\":\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/prize-announcement/\"},{\"title\":\"blue News Logo\",\"url\":\"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/\"},{\"title\":\"8 October 2026, Thursday, 14:39\",\"url\":\"https://charter97.org/en/news/2026/10/8/701166/\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary\"},{\"title\":\"Published: 20:58, October 8, 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.chinadailyhk.com/article/640768\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/blogs/pdf/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/current-affairs/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"By Ahaqir Ishaq | Books of BrilliancLast checked: October 2, 2026\",\"url\":\"https://booksofbrilliance.com/2026/10/02/2026-nobel-prize-literature/\"}]\n\nThe 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature has been awarded to Canadian poet Anne Carson. The Swedish Academy announced it on October 8, 2026, and the official Nobel site lists her as the sole laureate. The academy cited her \"bold and inventive\" work. Reports call her the second Canadian author to receive the honor. The award ceremony is set for December 10 in Stockholm.\n\nOne source from early October said the winner had not yet been named, but it predates the announcement, so the later reports supersede it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e04a101b-a411-417f-bde2-dcae248563f8","uuid":"055cc999-2900-4ca0-868f-e1252f48d3af","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:35:18.619Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner announced","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017PrqVe2g9SuW5Kx8FkdfKc","content":[{"title":"Live coverage of the announcement of the 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature","url":"https://www.ilfoglio.it/en/culture/2026/10/08/news/live-coverage-of-the-announcement-of-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature--409956"},{"title":"Prize announcement","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/prize-announcement/"},{"title":"blue News Logo","url":"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/"},{"title":"8 October 2026, Thursday, 14:39","url":"https://charter97.org/en/news/2026/10/8/701166/"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary"},{"title":"Published: 20:58, October 8, 2026","url":"https://www.chinadailyhk.com/article/640768"},{"title":"nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/blogs/pdf/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"},{"title":"nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/current-affairs/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"},{"title":"By Ahaqir Ishaq | Books of BrilliancLast checked: October 2, 2026","url":"https://booksofbrilliance.com/2026/10/02/2026-nobel-prize-literature/"}]},"The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature has been awarded to Canadian poet Anne Carson. The Swedish Academy announced it on October 8, 2026, and the official Nobel site